{"id":"maestra","lemma":"maestra","pos":"noun","rank":1871,"glosses":["queen bee"],"ipa":"/maˈestɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"maestras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-maestra.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo la llave maestra.","en":"I have the master key.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453715"},{"text":"Mis dos hermanas son maestras.","en":"Both my sisters are teachers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586599"},{"text":"Es una obra maestra.","en":"This is a masterpiece.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735924"},{"text":"Somos maestras.","en":"We are teachers."},{"text":"Su madre era maestra.","en":"His mother was a school teacher.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/825857"}]}